        "created_at": "2014-03-10T15:39:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>sky deck says targets doesnt it?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and OoO is for things that seem loke they happen at the same time. so Sky Deck+the drram or la capitan with unity out, it doesnt really matter</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>either players choose (in which the dreamer has the same result but you get a slight advantage against la capitan) or it goes by which is out first… which will always be the villain card.</p>\n<p>so… yeah. kinda moot question?</p>",
