      {
        "id": 94193,
        "name": "lynkfox",
        "username": "lynkfox",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-12T01:01:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I point to what i said in the other thread. What does your group think is best? This isnt copmetitive, this isnt a situation were one of you is going to win or loose based on the way the ruling goes. Either you win&nbsp;<em>together</em> or you loose together, and so a ruling on something you aren't sure how it will go... well it doesn't really matter does it? no one comes out ahead? If your group thinks it should be one way, do it!&nbsp;</p><p><br>Feel free to have fun with all the debating you want to, of course, but its a cooperative game. Just take a quick vote and don't stress it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Or, err ont he side of the players.</p>",
        "post_number": 27,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:20:39.041Z",
